    size(37,37,23) x12  gearboxes / gears  <- extracted
  The 12 gear parts are now separate <visual> elements in the conveyor_system
  link with the silver material, in
  GAZEBO/models/factory_assets/meshes/parts/conveyor_gear_00..11.dae
  IMPORTANT UNIT TRAP, opposite to the monolithic meshes: the split tool emits
  <unit meter="1" name="inch"/>, so the loader does NOT convert and these parts
