  sun <cast_shadows> true -> false. The fill light was already false.
  Log line count for shadow-related warnings this run: 0.
  Cameras advertising after restart: 8.

WHY: the geometry is flat interior wall panels, so a directional light with a
shadow map produces self-shadow acne and hard banding across every panel rather
