CHANGE 16 - 2026-10-04 - Flat single-colour structure + heavy edge linework

REQUEST: operator asked for the factory structure (previously tan) to be one
uniform colour with heavy edge linework.

FINDING - no outline pass exists in gz-sim 10. Verified in the server container:
  /usr/share/gz/gz-sim/media/gazebo.material has 90 materials; the only outline /
  wireframe support is a single polygon_mode wireframe pass inside
  Gazebo/TurquoiseGlowOutline, which draws every TRIANGLE of the DAE rather than
  real edges. libgz-rendering10 exports no Outline symbol. So edge linework
  cannot come from the render engine and is applied in the viewer instead.

