                 0.30 0.21 0.14 / 0.46 0.33 0.21 (tan) -> 0.72 0.72 0.74 flat,
                 specular 0.10 -> 0.02, shininess 6 -> 2. The massing is a single
                 visual, so one material drives the whole structure.
  portal/viewer/index.html  new applySobel(), run on the decoded frame before
                 it is blitted, plus an "edge lines" checkbox (on by default).
                 EDGE_MIN 5 / EDGE_MAX 46 bracket the real gradient range once
                 shadows are off and faces are flat.

BUG FOUND AND FIXED: the first implementation called applySobel AFTER
dctx.putImageData(out,0,0), so the modified pixels never reached the canvas and
the view was pixel-identical with the toggle on and off. Detected by comparing
